+The same `GDRCOPY_INCLUDEDIR` and `GDRCOPY_LIBDIR` variables work for
+per-module builds as well:
+
+```bash
+make -C src/device GDRCOPY_INCLUDEDIR=/path/to/include GDRCOPY_LIBDIR=/path/to/lib
